4. Before running this pipeline, configure Jenkins
You need to do these configurations only once.

A. Install Jenkins plugin

Go to:

Jenkins Dashboard → Manage Jenkins → Plugins → Available plugins.

Install:

- SonarQube Scanner for Jenkins

B. Configure SonarCloud server

Go to:

Jenkins Dashboard → Manage Jenkins → Configure System → SonarQube servers.

Add:

Setting

Value

Name

SonarCloud

Server URL

https://sonarcloud.io

Server authentication token

Your SonarCloud token

Generate your token from SonarCloud under My Account → Security.

Save the token in Jenkins credentials. Never put the token directly in your Jenkinsfile.

C. Configure webhook

For the Quality Gate stage to receive the result, configure a webhook in SonarCloud:

Open your SonarCloud project.

Go to Administration → Webhooks.

Add your Jenkins webhook URL:


text
https://YOUR-JENKINS-URL/sonarqube-webhook/
Your Jenkins server must be reachable by SonarCloud. 

