SonarCloud Analysis

Quality Gate

Scans your source code

Checks the analysis result

Finds vulnerabilities

Checks configured quality conditions

Finds bugs

Passes or fails

Finds code smells

Controls whether deployment continues

Important: SonarCloud analysis identifies issues, but the Quality Gate decides whether the pipeline should continue based on your configured conditions.

